OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 FEB
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GRedemptive love is Sarah Mohr-
OL,6,     GPietsch's destination with
OL,7,     GSchoenberg's heartfelt early
OL,8,     Gwork. Along the way, Sarah stops
OL,9,     Gfor music including JS Bach,
OL,10,     GWagner and Dolly Parton.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from the Chapel of St John's
OL,13,     GCollege, Cambridge, with music by
OL,14,     GWarlock, Errollyn Wallen and
OL,15,     GMendelssohn.
OL,16,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,17,     GAlyn Shipton present jazz records
OL,18,     Gof all styles, including music
OL,19,     Gfrom Camilla George, John
OL,20,     GMcLaughlin and the classic Joy
OL,21,     GSpring performed by Clifford
OL,22,     GBrown and Max Roach.
