OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 FEB
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French visits Christ
OL,6,     GChurch College in Oxford, which
OL,7,     Gwas founded as Cardinal College
OL,8,     Gby Cardinal Wolsey in 1525.
OL,9,G1800FWords and Music
OL,10,     GWe're thinking big as we
OL,11,     Gcontemplate giants, looking at
OL,12,     Gthe expanse of the sea, sky and
OL,13,     Gcosmos and meeting a host of
OL,14,     Gfictional giants - and the odd
OL,15,     Gelephant.
OL,16,G1915FBetween the Ears: The Gold Line
OL,17,     GThe high-frequency trading route
OL,18,     Gusing radio antennas between New
OL,19,     GYork and Chicago inspired a six-
OL,20,     Gweek recording road trip
OL,21,     Gfollowing the money on this high
OL,22,     Gspeed data race.
